<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nId<dd>The ID of an area of effect in <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Persistent%202da" title="Persistent 2da">persistent 2da</a><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">rScript<dd>The AOE event handler script<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nAoEVfx<dd>The ID of a visual effect in visual from <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/VFX%202da" title="VFX 2da">VFX_ 2da</a>
